Replace static const char *const pointer tables and the stage-mark switch in
shim/e1s-xnu/ui.c with fixed-width 2D char arrays and branch selection so the
freestanding loader linked at 0x0 contains zero R_AARCH64_ABS64 relocations in
C objects when S-Boot loads it at 0x80080000/0x800f0000.

